    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but isn't it kind of a problem though? if the \"value\" of art is just whatever political point it's trying to make, doesn't that mean the actual craft and talent of the artist doesn't even matter anymore? it feels like we're losing the thing that actually makes art art.",
